note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 6 line 170 and 4 lines 106-108: every index into an unsized view is checked at run time,
note even a constant one: get v 10 on len 10 traps 3 (exit 103, no stdout); it is not error 21.
om2
fn g v view uchar * to ulong
ret ulong get v 10
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
putd g a
ret 0
end
